# Route: guide 42 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 58, 42
# quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring, Azshara, Teldrassil, Alterac Mountains, Tirisfal Glades,
# Western Plaguelands, Eastern Plaguelands, Felwood, Durotar): Everlook -> Ice
# Thistle Hills -> Everlook -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Starfall Village ->
# Owl Wing Thicket -> Ravencrest Monument -> Ruins of Eldarath -> Ravencrest
# Monument -> The Ruined Reaches -> Ruins of Eldarath -> Rut'theran Village ->
# Dalaran -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Super Snapper FX (2944;
# Gammerita 48); Crushridge Warmongers (504; Crushridge Warmonger 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Drakefire Amulet (6502), In Search of Thaelrid (1198),
# Twilight Falls (1199), Starving Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458),
# Past Due (96800), Past Due (96800), Remember That I Love You (92415), Crest
# of Lordaeron (95189), Bloodied Insignia (95195), Abominable Creatures
# (95250), Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher
# (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466),
# Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Dawn's Gambit
# (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great
# Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above
# and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463),
# Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend
# (8948).

